{+neither the emptied `Number` (F-324) nor the distance's check stopped+}
[-both gates-]{+`Char` (F-54) is shown to be+}
[-stage started about 10 s before `testFast`, whose four JVMs ran beside it.-]{+cause.+}
[-`compile-ladder/climb-batch-26/gate/distance.txt`.-]{+`compile-ladder/climb-batch-27/gate/distance.txt`.+}
